/*
  ESP32 Mini OS for a 2.8" ILI9341 TFT with XPT2046 touch.

  Libraries to install in Arduino IDE:
  - Adafruit GFX Library
  - Adafruit ILI9341
  - XPT2046_Touchscreen

  ESP32 core libraries used by optional apps:
  - WiFi, HTTPClient, SPIFFS, ArduinoOTA

  Wiring used by this sketch:
    TFT VCC   -> ESP32 3V3/VCC
    TFT GND   -> ESP32 GND
    TFT CS    -> GPIO17
    TFT RESET -> GPIO5
    TFT D/C   -> GPIO16
    TFT MOSI  -> GPIO23
    TFT SCK   -> GPIO18
    TFT LED   -> GPIO32
    TFT MISO  -> GPIO19

    T_CLK     -> GPIO18
    T_CS      -> GPIO21
    T_DI      -> GPIO23
    T_DO      -> GPIO19
    T_IRQ     -> not connected
*/

